#: arena/forms.py:14
msgid "This is my photo, and I agree to display it in public voting."
msgstr "这是我本人的照片，我同意将它公开展示并参与投票。"

#: arena/forms.py:20
msgid "Your photo"
msgstr "你的照片"

#: arena/forms.py:20
msgid "Display name"
msgstr "展示名称"

#: arena/forms.py:22
msgid "JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 10 MB."
msgstr "支持 JPEG、PNG 或 WebP，大小不超过 10 MB。"

#: arena/forms.py:23
msgid "Optional. Your username is used if you leave this blank."
msgstr "选填，留空时显示你的用户名。"

#: arena/forms.py:33
msgid "Please choose a photo smaller than 10 MB."
msgstr "请选择大小不超过 10 MB 的照片。"

#: arena/forms.py:37
msgid "Please choose a JPEG, PNG or WebP photo."
msgstr "请选择 JPEG、PNG 或 WebP 格式的照片。"

#: arena/forms.py:39
msgid "Please choose a photo under 25 megapixels."
msgstr "请选择像素数不超过 2500 万的照片。"

#: arena/forms.py:50
msgid "This photo could not be read. Please choose a different image."
msgstr "无法读取这张照片，请选择另一张图片。"

#: arena/models.py:58
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "待投票"

#: arena/models.py:59
msgid "Voted"
msgstr "已投票"

#: arena/models.py:60
msgid "Skipped"
msgstr "已跳过"

#: arena/services.py:67
msgid "This matchup is no longer available."
msgstr "这组照片已不可用，请选择下一组。"

#: arena/services.py:69
msgid "This matchup has already been answered."
msgstr "你已经投票或跳过这组照片了。"

#: arena/services.py:79 arena/services.py:81 arena/tests.py:198
msgid "Choose one of the two photos."
msgstr "请从这两张照片中选择一张。"

#: arena/services.py:90
msgid "You cannot vote on your own photo."
msgstr "你不能为自己的照片投票。"

#: arena/tests.py:197 templates/arena/_duel.html:6
msgid "Two photos."
msgstr "两张照片，"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:5
msgid "THE PHOTO ARENA"
msgstr "自拍对决"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:6
msgid "Your choice."
msgstr "由你选择。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:7
msgid "Choose the photo you prefer. Every vote shapes the leaderboard."
msgstr "选出你更喜欢的照片，每一票都会影响排行榜。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:9
msgid "Voting statistics"
msgstr "投票统计"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:10
msgid "Your votes"
msgstr "你投出的票"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:12
msgid "Photos in play"
msgstr "参赛照片"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:20
msgid "Your vote is in."
msgstr "投票已记录。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "%(support)s of %(total)s votes share your choice."
msgstr "共 %(total)s 票，其中 %(support)s 票与你的选择相同。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:23
msgid "Your vote could not be saved. Please try again or refresh the page."
msgstr "投票未能保存，请重试或刷新页面。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:30 templates/arena/_duel.html:35
#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:10 templates/arena/photos.html:23
#, python-format
msgid "Photo by %(name)s"
msgstr "%(name)s 的照片"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:31 templates/arena/_duel.html:36
msgid "Choose this photo"
msgstr "选这张"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:40
msgid "to choose"
msgstr "选择照片"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:41
msgid "Skip this pair"
msgstr "跳过这组"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:42
msgid "Go with your instinct."
msgstr "跟着直觉选。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:51
msgid "ALL CAUGHT UP"
msgstr "全部看完啦"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:52
msgid "You've seen every pairing."
msgstr "你已经看完所有组合。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:53
msgid ""
"New photos bring new choices. Check the rankings or add a photo of your own."
msgstr "新照片会带来新的选择。看看排行榜，或者上传你自己的照片。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:55
msgid "ROOM FOR A FIRST IMPRESSION"
msgstr "准备登场"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:56
msgid "The first match starts with you."
msgstr "第一场对决，从你开始。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:57
msgid ""
"A match needs photos from two other people. Add yours and help get things "
"started."
msgstr "投票需要两位其他用户的照片。上传你的照片，让更多人有得选。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:59 templates/arena/photos.html:9
msgid "Upload a photo"
msgstr "上传照片"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:59
msgid "View leaderboard"
msgstr "查看排行榜"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:62
msgid "Every perspective is different. Yours counts."
msgstr "每个人的眼光不同，你的选择也重要。"

#: templates/arena/_duel.html:62
msgid "Put your photo in the mix"
msgstr "让你的照片也参赛"

#: templates/arena/home.html:3 templates/base.html:24
msgid "Vote"
msgstr "投票"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:3 templates/base.html:25
msgid "Leaderboard"
msgstr "排行榜"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:6
msgid "CHOSEN BY THE COMMUNITY"
msgstr "由大家共同选择"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:6
msgid "The"
msgstr "人气"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:6
msgid "leaderboard."
msgstr "排行榜。"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:6
msgid "A snapshot of shared preferences, shaped by every match."
msgstr "每一场对决，都在记录大家的偏好。"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:6
msgid "Cast your vote"
msgstr "去投票"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Photos ranked by community votes"
msgstr "照片投票排行榜"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Rank"
msgstr "排名"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Photo"
msgstr "照片"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Rating"
msgstr "积分"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Wins"
msgstr "胜出"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:9
msgid "Matches"
msgstr "对决"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:13
msgid ""
"Ratings reflect relative community preferences, not an objective measure of "
"beauty. New photos start at 1,000."
msgstr "积分反映参与者的相对偏好，并非客观颜值。新照片的初始积分为 1,000。"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:15
msgid "Every ranking starts somewhere."
msgstr "排行榜等待第一票。"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:15
msgid "Photos will appear here after their first vote."
msgstr "照片获得第一票后，就会出现在这里。"

#: templates/arena/leaderboard.html:15
msgid "Go to the arena"
msgstr "前往投票"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:3 templates/base.html:26
msgid "My photos"
msgstr "我的照片"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:6
msgid "YOUR SIDE OF THE STORY"
msgstr "展示你自己"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:6
msgid "A photo."
msgstr "一张照片，"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:6
msgid "A new perspective."
msgstr "一种新视角。"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:6
msgid "Share a selfie and see how the community responds."
msgstr "分享一张自拍，看看大家会怎样选择。"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:9
msgid "JOIN THE MIX"
msgstr "加入对决"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:13
msgid "Selected photo preview"
msgstr "已选照片预览"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:13
msgid "Choose your photo"
msgstr "选择照片"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:13
msgid "Or drop it here. JPEG, PNG or WebP."
msgstr "也可以拖到这里。支持 JPEG、PNG 或 WebP。"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:17
msgid "Add to the arena"
msgstr "上传并参赛"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:21
msgid "Your photos"
msgstr "你的照片"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:23
msgid "wins"
msgstr "次胜出"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:23
msgid "matches"
msgstr "次对决"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:23
msgid "Delete this photo and its voting history? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "确定删除这张照片及其投票记录吗？此操作无法撤销。"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:23
msgid "Delete photo"
msgstr "删除照片"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:25
msgid "Your first photo goes here."
msgstr "上传你的第一张照片。"

#: templates/arena/photos.html:25
msgid ""
"Upload a selfie to start receiving votes. You can delete it whenever you "
"like."
msgstr "上传自拍即可参与投票，你随时可以删除。"

#: templates/base.html:9
msgid "Two photos, one choice. Share your perspective on SharingFace."
msgstr "两张照片，一个选择。在 SharingFace 分享你的审美。"

#: templates/base.html:16
msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "跳转到主要内容"

#: templates/base.html:22
msgid "Main navigation"
msgstr "主导航"

#: templates/base.html:30
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: templates/base.html:38
msgid "Log out"
msgstr "退出登录"

#: templates/base.html:40 templates/registration/login.html:3
#: templates/registration/login.html:7 templates/registration/signup.html:7
msgid "Log in"
msgstr "登录"

#: templates/base.html:49
msgid "A matter of perspective."
msgstr "各有各的眼光。"

#: templates/base.html:50
msgid "Personal preferences, shared."
msgstr "分享你的偏好。"

#: templates/registration/login.html:6
msgid "A FAMILIAR FACE"
msgstr "又见面了"

#: templates/registration/login.html:6
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#: templates/registration/login.html:6
msgid "back."
msgstr "回来。"

#: templates/registration/login.html:6
msgid "Log in to share photos and keep your votes together."
msgstr "登录后即可分享照片，保存你的投票记录。"

#: templates/registration/login.html:6 templates/registration/signup.html:6
msgid "Just here to vote?"
msgstr "只想投票？直接开始"

#: templates/registration/login.html:7
msgid "New here?"
msgstr "第一次来？"

#: templates/registration/login.html:7 templates/registration/signup.html:3
#: templates/registration/signup.html:7
msgid "Create an account"
msgstr "注册账号"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:6
msgid "MAKE YOUR FIRST IMPRESSION"
msgstr "从这里认识你"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:6
msgid "Join the"
msgstr "分享"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:6
msgid "picture."
msgstr "你的照片。"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:6
msgid "An account gives your photos a home and your votes a history."
msgstr "创建账号，管理你的照片和投票记录。"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:7
msgid "Create account"
msgstr "创建账号"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:7
msgid "Already have an account?"
msgstr "已有账号？"
